# ...except per-animal result tables, which underwrite written claims and are
# the only citable numeric trace these MATLAB figure panels leave (2026-08-11).
!Striatum project/figures/stability_by_animal.csv
!Striatum project/figures/decoding_by_animal.csv
!Striatum project/figures/compare_bin_sizes_summary.csv
!Striatum project/rl_model/results/encoding_summary_by_animal.csv
