# Run logs from the headless pipeline chains — regenerable, and large.
Striatum project/processed_data/*.log
Striatum project/rl_model/results/*.log

# The curated manuscript panel set IS tracked: it is a hand-mapped selection
# copied out of the regenerable figures/ tree, and losing it costs the layout
# rather than a rerun (2026-08-12).
!documents/manuscript_figures/*.png
!documents/manuscript_figures/*.svg
